The customizer apps: licences
=============================

Copyright (c) 2026 Ahmed Walid (AXV).

The customizer apps are open source. Each folder keeps the licence of where
it comes from:

  Mozilla Public License 2.0 (the LICENSE file at the top of this repository)
    common/, kit/, noter/, school_mode/, work_mode/, file_saver/,
    data_place/, tools/, customizers.mk, kernel/build-kernel.sh,
    kernel/src/abi/ (the network system call interface: userspace, as abi/
    of itelx is), and the programs and installers built from them
    (release/*.xvr, release/*.txt). Change them and share them; changed
    files stay under the MPL 2.0 and their source must be available.

  itelx Kernel License 1.0 (kernel/LICENSE)
    kernel/src/kernel/ (the network stack and the network card drivers),
    kernel/itelx-1.4-net.patch, and the kernels built with them
    (kernel/out/, and inside file_saver.xvr and data_place.xvr). These are
    parts of the itelx kernel, published by its copyright holder. As that
    licence says, you may use them and share them unchanged, read them and
    send changes back, but you may not distribute a modified version.

  itelxOS 1.4, as published (factory/itelx-1.4/, and inside recustomize.xvr)
    the files of a newly installed itelxOS 1.4, unchanged: its kernel under
    the itelx Kernel License 1.0, its userspace under the MPL 2.0, its fonts
    and Unicode data under their own licences. The texts are in
    factory/itelx-1.4/rootfs/system/licenses.

  Public domain
    third_party/sqlite/ (SQLite 3.54.1, from sqlite.org, unchanged),
    compiled into sql, doc, dbscan, dbstat and dbserve of data_place.

Programs that run on itelx through its system calls are not derived from
the kernel: your own programs and customizers may be under any licence.
